#: src/components/FeaturesCard.svelte
msgid "How to use"
msgstr "Jinsi ya kutumia"

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Choose Add account, enter an account name, and select Create & sign in. Use the account switcher to return to an existing account."
msgstr "Chagua Ongeza akaunti, ingiza jina la akaunti, kisha chagua Unda na uingie. Tumia kibadilisha akaunti kurudi kwenye akaunti iliyopo."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Write your message and add at least one image; both are required. Use Next to move forward and Previous to edit an earlier step."
msgstr "Andika ujumbe na uongeze angalau picha moja; vyote vinahitajika. Tumia Inayofuata kuendelea na Iliyotangulia kuhariri hatua ya awali."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Select Load groups and finish Facebook login or verification in Chrome. Search the loaded list, select the groups you want, then choose Next."
msgstr "Chagua Pakia vikundi na ukamilishe kuingia Facebook au uthibitishaji katika Chrome. Tafuta kwenye orodha iliyopakiwa, chagua vikundi unavyotaka, kisha Inayofuata."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "In Settings, enter this account’s Gemini API key and model, then Save settings. Enable rewriting for your run and describe the tone and details to preserve."
msgstr "Katika Mipangilio, ingiza ufunguo wa API wa Gemini na modeli ya akaunti hii, kisha Hifadhi mipangilio. Washa uandishi upya na ueleze mtindo na maelezo ya kuhifadhi."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Review the account, message, image order, selected groups, and posting intervals. Choose Post now and complete any Facebook login or verification prompts in Chrome."
msgstr "Kagua akaunti, ujumbe, mpangilio wa picha, vikundi na vipindi vya kuchapisha. Chagua Chapisha sasa na ukamilishe kuingia Facebook au uthibitishaji katika Chrome."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Choose Schedule, select a future date and time in the displayed time zone, then Confirm schedule. Facebook may require login when the queue starts."
msgstr "Chagua Ratibu, weka tarehe na saa ya baadaye katika ukanda wa saa unaoonyeshwa, kisha Thibitisha ratiba. Facebook inaweza kuhitaji kuingia foleni inapoanza."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Open Posting logs to follow progress. Its account selector lets you inspect other queues without switching the account in the main workspace."
msgstr "Fungua Kumbukumbu za uchapishaji kufuatilia maendeleo. Kiteuzi chake cha akaunti hukuruhusu kukagua foleni nyingine bila kubadilisha akaunti katika eneo kuu la kazi."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Pause finishes the current operation before waiting. Resume continues the queue; Stop ends the remaining queue. Queues paused manually need Resume even after internet returns."
msgstr "Sitisha hukamilisha operesheni ya sasa kabla ya kusubiri. Endelea huendeleza foleni; Simamisha humaliza foleni iliyobaki. Foleni iliyositishwa kwa mkono inahitaji Endelea hata mtandao ukirudi."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Published means Facebook confirmed publication. Pending means admin approval is needed. Review failed or skipped entries; check unconfirmed submissions on Facebook before retrying to avoid duplicates."
msgstr "Imechapishwa humaanisha Facebook imethibitisha uchapishaji. Inasubiri huhitaji idhini ya msimamizi. Kagua yaliyoshindwa au kurukwa; hakiki machapisho yasiyothibitishwa kwenye Facebook kabla ya kujaribu tena ili kuepuka marudio."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "For problems, expand Debug details or Copy Facebook response in Posting logs. For expired logins, use Load groups and finish verification before trying again."
msgstr "Kwa matatizo, panua Maelezo ya utatuzi au Nakili jibu la Facebook kwenye kumbukumbu. Kwa kuingia kulikoisha muda, Pakia vikundi na ukamilishe uthibitishaji kabla ya kujaribu tena."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Use Language and Themes in the top bar. Your choices apply across windows."
msgstr "Tumia Lugha na Mandhari kwenye upau wa juu. Chaguo zako hutumika katika madirisha yote."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "Adding another account is optional. Use it only when you want a separate Facebook login and workspace."
msgstr "Kuongeza akaunti nyingine ni hiari. Itumie tu unapotaka kuingia Facebook na eneo la kazi tofauti."

#: src/components/UsageGuide.svelte
msgid "You can use the default account without adding another one. Sign in to Facebook when you choose Load groups in step 2."
msgstr "Unaweza kutumia akaunti chaguomsingi bila kuongeza nyingine. Ingia Facebook unapochagua Pakia vikundi katika hatua ya 2."

#: src/components/FeaturesCard.svelte
msgid "Features & How to Use"
msgstr "Vipengele na Jinsi ya Kutumia"
